   00738| // A bare summary directive standing alone is itself a request to summarize the
   00739| // running conversation ("summarize", "резюме", "总结", ...). For whitespace-
   00740| // delimited scripts the directive must be the whole prompt; for CJK (no word
   00741| // spaces) a leading directive suffices, mirroring the historical `^总结`
   00742| // anchor and keeping compounds like "工作总结" (a work summary) out. Mirror of
   00743| // summary_directive_leads in src/solver_handlers/mod.rs.
