   00834| // Does a meaning carrying `role` evidence one of the prompt's lowercased forms?
   00835| // Buckets every surface form of the role by its derived slot exactly as
   00836| // role_evidences_web_intent does in src/solver_handlers/web_requests.rs:
   00837| //   - "prefix": form.before must *begin* one of the prompt forms ("fetch …" →
   00838| //     "fetch google.com"); form.before keeps the trailing space.
   00839| //   - "bare": form.text must appear *anywhere* in one of the prompt forms
   00840| //     ("запрос к" → "сделать запрос к google.com").
